  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Domain and range of function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8477;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is a increasing function,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>]</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Similarly,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>for</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>ln</mi><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>ln</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence both <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;&amp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;are correct.<br />Note this question was bonus in Jee Main 2023 April session, as&nbsp;LMVT on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>ln</mi><mi>x</mi></math> can&#39;t be satisfied.</p><p>Hence, no such <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></math> exist.</p>"
  }
